  "description": "Support package, not an SDK: install the SDK package first (VisioForge.DotNet.VideoCapture, VisioForge.DotNet.MediaPlayer, VisioForge.DotNet.VideoEdit or VisioForge.DotNet.Core) and add this one only when the deployment guide lists it. MP4, MPEG-TS, MKV and HLS output for the VisioForge .NET SDKs (Windows engines) on Windows ARM64: the Media Foundation muxer and the VisioForge_MFT library with the Media Foundation H.264/H.265 encoders and the FFmpeg decoder of the low-latency RTSP source. Intel QSV, NVIDIA NVENC and the legacy x64 DirectShow H.264/AAC encoders and MP4 muxers have no Windows ARM64 build and are not included.",
